message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the versioned software release."
title: "Genuine Zero Uniform Atlas Energy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
license: MIT
version: 0.10.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact identity between the native real-camera
  and Genuine zero, the sharp critical cutoff-tail and collective raw-energy
  expansions, and exact logarithmic first and second cutoff jets. Version
  0.10.0 proves holomorphy of the exact scaled explicit-radius tail on a
  critical neighborhood, a uniform Cauchy-circle majorant, and explicit
  O(1/M) bounds for its value, first complex derivative, and second complex
  derivative. Together with the 0.9.0 transport theorem, these estimates close
  the analytic differentiated-remainder input without numerical premises.
  Empirical cutoff-doubling campaigns remain discovery provenance rather than
  kernel assumptions.
keywords:
